# -*- encoding: utf-8 -*-
# Arc: AlfredArc | Scene: MariusMarriage

translate pt strings:

    old "A man that had perhaps feared the day would never come."
    new "Um homem que talvez temia que aquele dia nunca viesse."

    old "A minute, then two, then-"
    new "Um minuto, depois dois, e então—"

    old "A man that had feared life had passed him by, and now equally feared that he had caught life but had no idea what to do with it."
    new "Um homem que temia que a vida tivesse passado por ele, e agora igualmente temia que a tivesse pegado, mas não sabia o que fazer com ela."

    old "A few hours later, the cry of new life could be heard."
    new "Algumas horas depois, o grito de uma nova vida pôde ser ouvido."

    old "A life she could remember having, but one that seemed to have happened to someone else."
    new "Uma vida que ela podia lembrar de ter tido, mas que parecia ter acontecido com outra pessoa."
